            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Wellness isn’t just about what you eat or how much you move—it’s also shaped by the small details in your environment. The air you breathe every day has a bigger impact on comfort, focus, and rest than most people realize. That’s why humidity and aroma together can transform your indoor environment into a true wellness space.</p><p>Balanced humidity helps reduce dryness in the air, which can irritate your skin, throat, and sinuses. But it also does something less obvious: it allows aroma to disperse more evenly. When the air is too dry, scents can feel sharp or fade too quickly. With the right humidity, aromas carry gently, creating a subtle and consistent sensory experience that enhances daily and nightly rituals.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
