            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>With the Dreamwell™ Humidifier, it pairs balanced humidity with the option to include thoughtfully curated aroma to support both rest and alertness. In the evening, a soft scent combined with humidity signals the body that it’s time to slow down, unwind, and prepare for sleep. During the day, the right aroma can create a sense of clarity, uplift your mood, and help you stay focused—even in busy or stressful spaces.</p><p>This combination turns everyday air care into a wellness ritual that fits seamlessly into daily life. Whether you’re reading, working from home, practicing mindfulness, or winding down at night, balanced humidity and aroma create a calming backdrop for your activities.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
