            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Curated scent collections like The Serenity Collection (Light and Clarity) and The Awakening Collection (Calm and Dream<strong>)</strong> take this experience even further. Serenity is designed to help you relax and restore balance, while Awakening is perfect for focus, clarity, and energizing your space. Together with humidity, these aromas don’t just smell good—they actively support how you feel, day and night.</p><p>By combining clean air, balanced humidity, and aroma, the Dreamwell Humidifier helps you create a space that feels comfortable, intentional, and truly restorative. It’s not just about improving the air you breathe—it’s about enhancing the environment where you live, work, and rest.</p>",
